WEBVTT

00:01:32.400 --> 00:01:36.090
They referred to the flying 
gaichuu as a "Cabernet."

00:01:36.740 --> 00:01:40.370
I searched along the southeast coast, 
but I couldn't determine where it went.

00:01:40.670 --> 00:01:42.970
I believe that its flight 
path must have changed

00:01:42.970 --> 00:01:45.150
after Lag and Gauche shot 
off one of its wings.

00:01:45.150 --> 00:01:46.290
I see.

00:01:46.290 --> 00:01:50.400
So Reverse planned to attack 
the capital, Akatsuki, by air.

00:01:50.400 --> 00:01:53.340
And they were aiming to take 
out the artificial sun...

00:01:54.000 --> 00:01:57.910
Turning Amberground into a 
land of complete darkness?

00:01:59.000 --> 00:02:02.510
Do they really think that'll destroy 
the stratified-class society?

00:02:02.920 --> 00:02:05.320
They're more shallow 
minded than I thought.

00:02:05.850 --> 00:02:09.480
At any rate, the government 
considers this a serious threat.

00:02:09.740 --> 00:02:11.940
At the request of the government,

00:02:11.940 --> 00:02:14.980
the Bee Hive will spare some personnel 
to go and take down the Cabernet.

00:02:14.980 --> 00:02:18.210
I'd like you to head out east 
to investigate immediately.

00:02:18.210 --> 00:02:19.990
Of course. If you'll excuse me...

00:02:26.160 --> 00:02:27.850
Now then, Aria-kun...

00:02:27.850 --> 00:02:30.370
I have a delivery I'd like you to help with.

00:02:30.370 --> 00:02:32.310
What? Me?

00:02:32.310 --> 00:02:32.880
What about Lag?

00:02:33.360 --> 00:02:35.340
He's still being examined.

00:02:37.560 --> 00:02:42.700
Crimson Melody

00:02:37.940 --> 00:02:40.010
You've developed a fever from over-exertion.

00:02:40.440 --> 00:02:43.300
Both your body and heart 
are seriously exhausted.

00:02:43.670 --> 00:02:45.310
It's no wonder you collapsed.

00:02:45.310 --> 00:02:49.020
Actually, ever since I got back, 
I haven't been feeling so well.

00:02:49.020 --> 00:02:53.510
As usual, you shot too many shindans... I'm 
pretty sure I told you to keep that in check.

00:02:53.850 --> 00:02:54.940
I'm sorry...

00:02:55.370 --> 00:02:58.680
Rest for a while. Got it?

00:02:59.390 --> 00:03:00.130
Yes...

00:03:01.630 --> 00:03:06.420
With Lag Seeing in that condition, 
I'm really short handed, you know.

00:03:06.420 --> 00:03:09.270
But it's been quite a while since 
I retired from active deliveries...

00:03:09.270 --> 00:03:11.180
Oh, come on. Don't say that.

00:03:11.410 --> 00:03:12.650
Don't you think this is a good chance

00:03:12.650 --> 00:03:16.410
to learn about current delivery conditions 
as the Bee Hive's Sub Master?

00:03:16.410 --> 00:03:17.670
Uh...

00:03:18.690 --> 00:03:20.750
Houdai Franklin?

00:03:21.050 --> 00:03:23.890
Delivery was refused, so it 
was returned to us from Astor.

00:03:24.280 --> 00:03:29.460
I was curious, so I looked into it, and it 
seems he used to be a part of the airship crew.

00:03:29.460 --> 00:03:30.760
The airship?

00:03:31.070 --> 00:03:33.440
So can I ask you to do this?

00:03:34.740 --> 00:03:35.830
Understood.

00:03:37.590 --> 00:03:38.520
Good luck.

00:03:55.550 --> 00:03:56.670
I'm in!

00:03:59.520 --> 00:04:00.840
Sure been a while...

00:04:04.760 --> 00:04:07.640
What is it, Bolt? You worried about me?

00:04:09.550 --> 00:04:13.210
Can't get anything past you, can I?  Don't worry.

00:04:13.210 --> 00:04:16.450
I'm just going out for a 
bit, that's all, Bolt...

00:04:17.770 --> 00:04:20.280
What? Aria-san is going on a delivery?

00:04:20.280 --> 00:04:23.790
Yup! I figured I'd send her out for bit...

00:04:23.790 --> 00:04:25.170
Don't have enough personnel, see?

00:04:25.170 --> 00:04:27.500
But... Send her out?

00:04:27.770 --> 00:04:30.970
I'm sorry... If I hadn't collapsed, then...

00:04:31.430 --> 00:04:32.790
Will she be okay?

00:04:33.910 --> 00:04:36.420
I think she'd have no problem 
with normal delivery, but...

00:04:37.140 --> 00:04:38.820
What do you mean?

00:04:38.820 --> 00:04:43.220
You don't know about her back when 
she was in the field, Seeing...

00:04:46.610 --> 00:04:49.350
She has almost no coordination at all!

00:04:49.350 --> 00:04:51.050
Almost none?

00:04:51.050 --> 00:04:53.000
She's so bad, I wish I could dissect her!

00:04:53.000 --> 00:04:54.470
That bad?

00:04:54.470 --> 00:04:57.300
Well, it has been a while for her...

00:04:57.300 --> 00:04:59.300
And she doesn't have a 
dingo with her, right?

00:04:59.300 --> 00:05:00.310
No...

00:05:00.310 --> 00:05:02.280
Oh, right... A dingo...

00:05:02.640 --> 00:05:07.500
Hey, Niche... Would you go with 
Aria-san and make sure she's okay?

00:05:07.500 --> 00:05:08.640
I don't wanna!

00:05:08.640 --> 00:05:10.660
But Aria-san doesn't have a dingo...

00:05:10.660 --> 00:05:15.120
But I'm <i>your</i> dingo, Lag! I'm no 
one's dingo other than Lag's!

00:05:15.740 --> 00:05:20.730
But Niche... Aria-san is doing 
this delivery in my place...

00:05:21.050 --> 00:05:24.820
Niche, I want you to go with Aria-san, 
who is doing my delivery...

00:05:24.820 --> 00:05:28.320
...with me as Aria-san's dingo as you...

00:05:28.320 --> 00:05:30.930
...and Niche as dingo with Aria-san and...

00:05:30.930 --> 00:05:34.400
...protect them as dingo Niche...

00:05:35.830 --> 00:05:37.600
Seeing, are you all right?

00:05:38.150 --> 00:05:40.590
Don't force yourself. Rest well.

00:05:41.980 --> 00:05:43.760
So that's why you're coming?

00:05:44.230 --> 00:05:45.980
You sure you don't want to stay with Lag?

00:05:46.400 --> 00:05:47.940
The poor thing.

00:05:47.940 --> 00:05:49.180
Poor thing?

00:05:49.180 --> 00:05:52.390
He could barely say my name...

00:05:52.810 --> 00:05:55.660
In that case, it'd be 
better to go back to him.

00:05:55.920 --> 00:05:57.790
I have no need for a dingo, thank you.

00:05:57.790 --> 00:05:59.830
I am not your dingo!

00:06:01.250 --> 00:06:06.950
I am Lag's dingo, and I am going with Aria 
who is doing Lag's delivery as Dag's lingo!

00:06:05.480 --> 00:06:06.950
Right, right, okay!

00:06:06.950 --> 00:06:08.370
Fine then, glad to have you.

00:06:08.370 --> 00:06:11.090
I think Lag might be able to 
rest better without you around!

00:06:15.090 --> 00:06:17.650
I can't relax with you 
hopping around like that.

00:06:17.650 --> 00:06:18.850
Let's walk together.

00:06:24.790 --> 00:06:25.980
Wait, Niche!

00:06:28.080 --> 00:06:29.230
Sheesh...

00:06:33.600 --> 00:06:37.010
So he moved from Astor to 
Goodbye Amsterdam, it seems.

00:06:37.520 --> 00:06:39.760
There's a risk of gaichuu appearing,

00:06:39.760 --> 00:06:42.380
but the pond path through 
Black Cherry Pool is a short cut.

00:06:43.100 --> 00:06:45.700
So he refused the letter and then moved?

00:06:45.700 --> 00:06:46.880
This might be a bit tricky.

00:06:46.880 --> 00:06:48.970
Lag can handle tricky no problem!

00:06:48.970 --> 00:06:51.350
He delivers the letter no matter what!

00:06:51.350 --> 00:06:53.800
My Lag is the number one Bee!

00:06:55.210 --> 00:06:57.850
Well, it's only natural since 
you love him so, Niche.

00:06:57.850 --> 00:07:00.690
But Sylvette is a really 
tough rival, you know.

00:07:00.690 --> 00:07:03.810
I am aware that Sylvette 
is a dangerous woman.

00:07:04.460 --> 00:07:06.850
She's a hundred times stronger than Lag.

00:07:06.850 --> 00:07:09.810
And the pukeyness of her pukey 
soup is serious business.

00:07:21.100 --> 00:07:24.400
Niche! That's the pond path 
through Black Cherry Pool.

00:07:24.400 --> 00:07:25.210
Pond?

00:07:28.780 --> 00:07:33.530
Niche! There's very little room to walk 
along this pond path, so be careful!

00:07:40.010 --> 00:07:41.440
I didn't realize it was this deep...

00:07:43.620 --> 00:07:45.980
I remember being able to do this 
a lot better back in the day...

00:07:49.250 --> 00:07:51.560
Niche! Be careful where you step!

00:07:51.560 --> 00:07:53.320
<i>You</i> be careful!

00:07:53.950 --> 00:07:56.280
I'll carry that big thing in your way.

00:07:56.280 --> 00:07:58.210
Because I'm nice like that!

00:07:58.210 --> 00:07:59.080
Give it!

00:07:59.080 --> 00:08:01.150
I'm fine, really!

00:08:01.150 --> 00:08:03.930
You just concentrate on 
taking care of yourself.

00:08:03.930 --> 00:08:08.850
I promised Lag that I would 
protect you as I am Lag's dingo!

00:08:08.850 --> 00:08:11.350
If I can't protect you, what then? You idiot!

00:08:11.350 --> 00:08:13.100
Don't call me an idiot!

00:08:13.100 --> 00:08:16.240
I don't want to be protected 
by any dingo except him!

00:08:16.240 --> 00:08:17.850
Thanks but no thanks!

00:08:18.520 --> 00:08:19.930
Aria's dingo?

00:08:32.750 --> 00:08:33.860
Gaichuu...

00:08:34.450 --> 00:08:36.190
Tequila Sunrise...

00:08:44.190 --> 00:08:44.870
Niche...

00:08:45.130 --> 00:08:46.520
You don't have to tell me.

00:08:46.520 --> 00:08:47.500
I know.

00:08:49.500 --> 00:08:52.530
R-Run away as fast as you can!

00:08:52.530 --> 00:08:53.550
Why?

00:08:53.550 --> 00:08:55.280
What about a shindan?

00:08:55.280 --> 00:08:57.390
My shindan are a special type...

00:08:57.390 --> 00:09:01.670
Listen, Niche. A Bee's job 
is delivering letters.

00:09:01.670 --> 00:09:03.730
There is no reason to fight unnecessarily.

00:09:04.930 --> 00:09:06.130
Now, as fast as we can!

00:09:07.610 --> 00:09:08.600
Enough!

00:09:11.070 --> 00:09:13.780
Niche! Don't go off on your own!

00:09:15.570 --> 00:09:18.450
When I'm with Lag, I do it like this!

00:09:18.450 --> 00:09:19.120
And with this...

00:09:19.120 --> 00:09:20.740
I do this!

00:09:26.730 --> 00:09:29.250
Stop it, Niche! It's 
dangerous to provoke them!

00:09:32.000 --> 00:09:33.090
Niche!

00:09:43.810 --> 00:09:48.140
Steak is saying that their weak point 
are gaps in the back of their heads!

00:09:50.270 --> 00:09:53.060
Beat them with a shindan! Hurry!

00:09:53.060 --> 00:09:55.290
Sheesh! What am I supposed to do with you?

00:09:58.410 --> 00:09:59.980
My shingengakki...

00:09:58.410 --> 00:10:03.710
<b>[Shingengakki: Heart Stringed Musical Instrument]</b>

00:09:59.980 --> 00:10:03.710
"Sonata for Unaccompanied 
Violin in G minor No. 1"

00:10:03.980 --> 00:10:07.150
The melody I play is a 
fragment of my heart...

00:10:19.500 --> 00:10:20.580
This is...

00:10:20.830 --> 00:10:22.130
The tempo is too fast!

00:10:23.260 --> 00:10:24.620
I have to calm down...

00:10:31.560 --> 00:10:34.000
I wonder how long it's been since 
I've done an attack shindan?

00:10:34.320 --> 00:10:37.310
No... I can't let my mind wander.

00:10:37.670 --> 00:10:39.820
Must concentrate... Concentrate...

00:10:40.250 --> 00:10:42.110
Put my heart into it...

00:10:42.110 --> 00:10:44.380
Resound Ari-Needle!

00:10:44.380 --> 00:10:46.700
T-That's not what it's called!

00:10:46.700 --> 00:10:48.190
Don't get in the way, Niche!

00:10:48.190 --> 00:10:50.310
Whatever! Just hurry and shoot!

00:10:50.310 --> 00:10:52.790
I have to concentrate or it 
won't form into a shindan!

00:10:54.000 --> 00:10:57.340
My heart isn't as young and 
pure as Lag's is, you know...

00:11:10.400 --> 00:11:12.980
Concentrate... Have to concentrate...

00:11:13.480 --> 00:11:17.790
I have to play the melody perfectly, or 
it won't resonate inside the gaichuu...

00:11:19.340 --> 00:11:21.840
Aria! Do it on a scramble dash!

00:11:21.840 --> 00:11:24.190
Please Niche, don't disturb me!

00:11:24.190 --> 00:11:26.780
I have to concentrate or it 
won't form into a shindan!

00:11:28.290 --> 00:11:29.540
Run, Niche!

00:11:30.260 --> 00:11:32.370
I won't run! As I am a dingo!

00:11:35.800 --> 00:11:36.630
Niche!

00:11:39.550 --> 00:11:41.760
Niche, don't be reckless!

00:11:47.690 --> 00:11:51.010
Honestly... What does she 
mean, "As I am a dingo?"

00:11:55.500 --> 00:11:56.310
Aria!

00:11:58.440 --> 00:11:59.400
Aria!

00:12:00.650 --> 00:12:02.360
Can I give him a name?

00:12:05.300 --> 00:12:07.400
Thanks, Dad!

00:12:10.250 --> 00:12:12.280
His paws are really big...

00:12:12.280 --> 00:12:15.300
Look! He's got a bad scar on his forehead...

00:12:15.300 --> 00:12:17.880
It looks like a thunderbolt...

00:12:18.910 --> 00:12:22.170
I got it! I'll name you Bolt!

00:12:42.670 --> 00:12:46.250
You say that Aria Link developed 
another delivery route?

00:12:46.490 --> 00:12:49.870
Looks like we'll be able to travel 
more efficiently between towns now.

00:12:49.870 --> 00:12:51.320
It's all thanks to her.

00:12:57.130 --> 00:12:59.380
Don't you mean it's all thanks to Bolt?

00:12:59.750 --> 00:13:01.730
Aria's blessed having a dingo like that.

00:13:02.390 --> 00:13:03.730
Seriously.

00:13:05.870 --> 00:13:08.370
I know that all too well...

00:13:09.180 --> 00:13:11.190
You think so too. Right, Bolt?

00:13:13.600 --> 00:13:14.520
Bolt...

00:13:14.520 --> 00:13:17.290
I'm sorry for being such a worthless owner...

00:13:18.270 --> 00:13:19.450
I'm really sorry.

00:13:20.750 --> 00:13:24.520
But you're the only one I can count on.

00:13:24.930 --> 00:13:28.630
So... Please let me count on you, okay, Bolt?

00:13:31.830 --> 00:13:33.470
W-What?

00:13:33.790 --> 00:13:36.810
Bolt! What is it?

00:13:42.740 --> 00:13:44.800
The tentacles that suck out your heart are...

00:13:52.600 --> 00:13:53.540
Niche!

00:13:55.650 --> 00:13:59.190
No matter how strong I am, 
I cannot defeat gaichuu!

00:13:59.190 --> 00:14:01.940
You are the only one who can defeat them!

00:14:03.050 --> 00:14:07.990
Even though I am Lag's dingo Niche, 
I still have to rely on your shindan!

00:14:08.400 --> 00:14:10.200
That's also what Bolt said!

00:14:11.410 --> 00:14:12.490
Bolt...

00:14:16.840 --> 00:14:17.790
Niche?

00:14:17.790 --> 00:14:20.800
After that he said, "Rely on 
me! Rely on me! Rely on me!"

00:14:20.800 --> 00:14:24.420
"I will protect you completely, 
Aria! Protect you!"

00:14:25.440 --> 00:14:28.920
Your dingo was really something 
really special too.

00:14:32.420 --> 00:14:33.590
Thank you.

00:14:33.900 --> 00:14:35.110
I'm sorry.

00:14:35.540 --> 00:14:38.170
I should have trusted you more, shouldn't I?

00:14:46.900 --> 00:14:50.940
Sonata No. 1 for Unaccompanied 
Violin in G minor.

00:14:57.910 --> 00:15:00.730
Resound! Crimson Melody!

00:15:21.100 --> 00:15:23.180
You got them all at once!

00:15:26.860 --> 00:15:27.730
Aria!

00:15:36.800 --> 00:15:37.530
Bolt...

00:15:42.400 --> 00:15:43.580
Niche!

00:15:43.580 --> 00:15:45.380
You are something too!

00:15:45.380 --> 00:15:48.880
Even Lag can't get them all at once!

00:15:49.910 --> 00:15:51.130
Niche...

00:15:54.520 --> 00:15:55.640
Thank you.

00:15:56.920 --> 00:15:59.420
You're an amazing dingo too, Niche.

00:16:00.930 --> 00:16:03.880
But not as great as my Bolt, got it?

00:16:04.800 --> 00:16:07.480
And you're no Lag, either!

00:16:08.710 --> 00:16:10.910
Gauche! Wait, Gauche!

00:16:10.910 --> 00:16:12.030
Aria Link...

00:16:12.030 --> 00:16:13.990
You're going on a delivery again?

00:16:12.310 --> 00:16:14.380
Oh, my! My memories!

00:16:14.380 --> 00:16:15.810
But you just returned...

00:16:15.810 --> 00:16:16.450
Yes.

00:16:16.840 --> 00:16:18.660
You need to rest a little.

00:16:18.950 --> 00:16:21.120
Haven't you been working non-stop lately?

00:16:21.120 --> 00:16:22.540
Your heart won't hold up!

00:16:23.720 --> 00:16:25.790
U-Um, Gauche...

00:16:26.250 --> 00:16:29.140
Would you like to come over 
to my place to eat something?

00:16:29.140 --> 00:16:31.550
I kinda made too much, so...

00:16:31.850 --> 00:16:35.280
In that case, perhaps you could call Sylvette over instead?

00:16:36.250 --> 00:16:37.700
I will be fine myself.

00:16:38.060 --> 00:16:39.640
You are very kind, Aria.

00:16:40.050 --> 00:16:41.810
Thank you. I will be on my way.

00:16:56.430 --> 00:16:58.340
A first present to celebrate your promotion.

00:16:58.340 --> 00:16:59.960
Don't worry, we'll celebrate 
it properly later.

00:16:59.960 --> 00:17:01.950
T-Thank you, Aria Link.

00:17:02.510 --> 00:17:04.320
I'll be lonely, but...

00:17:04.650 --> 00:17:07.140
You've always been working 
for this moment, Gauche...

00:17:10.210 --> 00:17:11.210
Aria...

00:17:13.130 --> 00:17:14.180
Congratulations!

00:17:15.140 --> 00:17:17.960
Take this to Sylvette Suede.

00:17:19.800 --> 00:17:23.100
I'm sorry, but Gauche has been terminated.

00:17:23.100 --> 00:17:24.390
But that's...

00:17:25.450 --> 00:17:27.730
Bolt can no longer see much at all.

00:17:28.050 --> 00:17:29.650
His body has weakened considerably as well...

00:17:30.190 --> 00:17:32.860
Even the Brave Warrior Bolt 
can't defeat old age...

00:17:33.810 --> 00:17:36.280
It's about time you had him retire.

00:17:37.370 --> 00:17:40.030
I'm sorry, but I have deliveries to make...

00:17:43.070 --> 00:17:43.660
Bolt?

00:17:50.300 --> 00:17:51.460
Bolt!

00:17:53.670 --> 00:17:56.110
Bolt... I know...

00:17:57.140 --> 00:17:59.550
Stay by my side and protect me, okay?

00:18:00.040 --> 00:18:03.100
Protect me forever and ever...

00:18:03.100 --> 00:18:04.120
Bolt...

00:18:06.910 --> 00:18:10.600
That day I retired from being a Bee...

00:18:11.400 --> 00:18:15.980
I planned on quitting the Bee 
Hive, but Master Lloyd stopped me.

00:18:16.980 --> 00:18:19.790
It turns out that I was more 
suited to office work anyway.

00:18:20.340 --> 00:18:22.990
The Master really looks out 
for his people like that.

00:18:23.590 --> 00:18:25.420
What happened to Bolt?

00:18:25.900 --> 00:18:28.960
He's protecting me. Now and forever.

00:18:31.150 --> 00:18:32.380
I see!

00:18:32.380 --> 00:18:34.740
So he's still your dingo!

00:18:35.660 --> 00:18:37.130
I see, I see!

00:18:47.610 --> 00:18:51.080
Hello, Signal... I bid you a good day, Monsieur.

00:18:51.530 --> 00:18:55.290
The Bees are searching toward 
eastern Yodaka for the gaichuu.

00:18:55.290 --> 00:18:59.950
We Reverse have already 
spotted the gaichuu Cabernet.

00:18:59.950 --> 00:19:01.860
There is no need to be concerned.

00:19:01.860 --> 00:19:06.850
The many years you brothers have waited for revenge 
against the government that did this to your bodies,

00:19:06.850 --> 00:19:09.250
will soon be coming to an end, Signal.

00:19:09.860 --> 00:19:11.880
Or should I say, Camus...

00:19:12.800 --> 00:19:18.920
The Cabernet will devour the capital's 
artificial sun made from people's hearts...

00:19:18.920 --> 00:19:21.410
It will consume it all, yes!

00:19:25.980 --> 00:19:40.970
Next: The Day of Flicker
